      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DODGEM DASH (1) had been in great form but missed the frame latest when sixth (17.47) in a Grade 5 at Casino. Generally fast to begin but always back from the wide draw last time. Goes very well here at the trip finding the frame in each of six starts. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in two starts. Has ability and can bounce back. UNIQUE ABILITY (2) hit the ground running from the squeeze draw with a slick early split, holding on for a minor placing when third and beaten 2.25 lengths at this track over 352m in 19.95. Leading chance. GO WILD GYPSY (3) is better than last start when fourth (20.06) in a Restricted WIN at this track over 352m. Bold showing expected. JUST IN CASEY (6) comes here off a freshen-up in a suitable contest.",
